Source: heroic-games-launcher
Section: games
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), binutils, xz-utils, zstd
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/Heroic-Games-Launcher/HeroicGamesLauncher

Package: heroic
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme, libasound2t64, libatk1.0-0t64, libatk-bridge2.0-0t64, libatspi2.0-0, libcairo2, libcups2t64, libdbus-1-3, libexpat1, libgbm1, libglib2.0-0t64, libgtk-3-0t64, libnotify4, libnspr4, libnss3, libpango-1.0-0, libsecret-1-0, libudev1, libuuid1, libx11-6, libxcb1, libxcomposite1, libxdamage1, libxext6, libxfixes3, libxkbcommon0, libxrandr2, libxss1, libxtst6, xdg-utils
Description: Open source GOG, Epic and Amazon games launcher
 Heroic is a free, open-source game launcher for GOG, Epic and Amazon
 Games.
